---
interface Props {
  lang?: 'id' | 'en';
}

const { lang = 'id' } = Astro.props;
const lastUpdated = "16 Oktober 2026";
const lastUpdatedEn = "October 16, 2026";
---

<div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-20 max-w-4xl text-zinc-300">
  {lang === 'id' ? (
    <article class="space-y-8">
      <div class="border-b border-zinc-800 pb-8">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
          Dokumen Hukum & Kepatuhan
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">Kebijakan Privasi (Privacy Policy)</h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-zinc-400 mt-2">Terakhir diperbarui: {lastUpdated}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 leading-relaxed text-zinc-300">
        <p>
          Selamat datang di <strong>ZilyaDigital</strong> (dapat diakses melalui <a href="https://zilyadigital.com" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">zilyadigital.com</a> dan <a href="https://nazilah.id" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">nazilah.id</a>). Privasi pengunjung dan klien kami adalah prioritas utama kami. Dokumen Kebijakan Privasi ini menjelaskan jenis data pribadi yang kami kumpulkan, bagaimana kami menggunakannya, dan bagaimana hak privasi Anda dilindungi.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white pt-4 border-t border-zinc-800/80">1. Informasi yang Kami Kumpulkan</h2>
        <p>
          Kami mengumpulkan data yang Anda berikan secara langsung saat Anda mendaftarkan akun klien, mengisi formulir konsultasi, atau berkomunikasi dengan tim kami:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Data Identitas & Kontak:</strong> Nama lengkap, alamat email bisnis/pribadi, nomor telepon/WhatsApp, dan nama instansi/perusahaan.</li>
          <li><strong>Data Proyek & Layanan:</strong> Kebutuhan spesifikasi website/aplikasi, berkas aset visual, dan catatan komunikasi konsultasi.</li>
          <li><strong>Data Transaksi:</strong> Riwayat tagihan faktur, paket layanan terpilih, dan bukti konfirmasi pembayaran. Kami <em>tidak</em> menyimpan kredensial kartu kredit/debit secara langsung; seluruh transaksi diproses melalui payment gateway berlisensi (mis. DOKU).</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white pt-4 border-t border-zinc-800/80">2. Kebijakan Data Pengguna Google (Google OAuth)</h2>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-900/80 border border-blue-500/30 space-y-3">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path fill="#4285F4" d="M22.56 12.25c0-.78-.07-1.53-.2-2.25H12v4.26h5.92c-.26 1.37-1.04 2.53-2.21 3.31v2.77h3.57c2.08-1.92 3.28-4.74 3.28-8.09z" />
              <path fill="#34A853" d="M12 23c2.97 0 5.46-.98 7.28-2.66l-3.57-2.77c-.98.66-2.23 1.06-3.71 1.06-2.86 0-5.29-1.93-6.16-4.53H2.18v2.84C3.99 20.53 7.7 23 12 23z" />
              <path fill="#FBBC05" d="M5.84 14.09c-.22-.66-.35-1.36-.35-2.09s.13-1.43.35-2.09V7.06H2.18C1.43 8.55 1 10.22 1 12s.43 3.45 1.18 4.94l2.85-2.22.81-.63z" />
              <path fill="#EA4335" d="M12 5.38c1.62 0 3.06.56 4.21 1.64l3.15-3.15C17.45 2.09 14.97 1 12 1 7.7 1 3.99 3.47 2.18 7.06l3.66 2.84c.87-2.6 3.3-4.52 6.16-4.52z" />
            </svg>
            Integrasi Otentikasi Google Sign-In
          </h3>
          <p>
            Ketika Anda memilih fitur <strong>"Masuk dengan Google"</strong> atau <strong>"Daftar dengan Google"</strong>, aplikasi kami meminta izin akses terbatas (scopes: <code class="text-xs bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">openid</code>, <code class="text-xs bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">email</code>, <code class="text-xs bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">profile</code>).
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li><strong>Data yang diakses:</strong> Nama profil pengguna, alamat email terverifikasi Google, dan URL foto profil publik.</li>
            <li><strong>Tujuan penggunaan:</strong> Memverifikasi identitas Anda secara instan tanpa perlu mengingat password tambahan, membuat atau menghubungkan akun portal klien Anda, serta mengamankan sesi sesi login terenkripsi.</li>
            <li><strong>Kepatuhan Ketat (Limited Use):</strong> Penggunaan data yang diterima dari Google APIs oleh ZilyaDigital mematuhi sepenuhnya <a href="https://developers.google.com/terms/api-services-user-data-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-400 underline">Kebijakan Data Pengguna Layanan Google API</a>, termasuk persyaratan <em>Limited Use</em>.</li>
            <li><strong>Tidak Ada Penjualan Data:</strong> Kami tidak pernah menjual, menyewakan, atau mentransfer data pengguna Google kepada broker data pihak ketiga atau platform pengiklan eksternal.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white pt-4 border-t border-zinc-800/80">3. Bagaimana Kami Menggunakan Informasi Anda</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>Menyediakan, mengoperasikan, dan memelihara portal klien ZilyaDigital.</li>
          <li>Mengirimkan update penting terkait progres pengerjaan software, peluncuran website, dan invoice tagihan.</li>
          <li>Merespons pertanyaan teknis, konsultasi kebutuhan digital, dan tiket kendala bantuan klien.</li>
          <li>Mencegah aktivitas ilegal, unauthorized access, atau penyalahgunaan platform.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white pt-4 border-t border-zinc-800/80">4. Penyimpanan & Keamanan Data</h2>
        <p>
          Data Anda disimpan pada infrastruktur cloud berkeamanan tinggi dengan enkripsi standar industri (TLS 1.3 / HTTPS). Token otentikasi disimpan dalam cookie berstatus <code class="text-xs bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">HTTPOnly</code> dan <code class="text-xs bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">SameSite</code> untuk mencegah serangan Cross-Site Scripting (XSS).
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white pt-4 border-t border-zinc-800/80">5. Hak Pengguna & Penghapusan Akun</h2>
        <p>
          Anda memiliki hak untuk:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>Meminta salinan data pribadi yang kami simpan tentang Anda.</li>
          <li>Memperbarui atau mengoreksi informasi profil Anda yang tidak akurat.</li>
          <li><strong>Mencabut izin Google Sign-In:</strong> Anda dapat mencabut akses kapan saja melalui halaman <a href="https://myaccount.google.com/permissions" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-400 underline">Keamanan Akun Google</a> Anda.</li>
          <li><strong>Meminta Penghapusan Data Permanen:</strong> Anda berhak mengajukan permohonan penghapusan seluruh data akun klien Anda dengan menghubungi kami di <a href="mailto:support@zilyadigital.com" class="text-blue-400 underline">support@zilyadigital.com</a> atau WhatsApp resmi kami.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white pt-4 border-t border-zinc-800/80">6. Kontak Kami</h2>
        <p>
          Jika Anda memiliki pertanyaan tentang Kebijakan Privasi ini atau tata kelola data di ZilyaDigital, silakan hubungi tim kami:
        </p>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 text-sm space-y-1">
          <p><strong>ZilyaDigital Software & Web Agency</strong></p>
          <p>Email: <a href="mailto:support@zilyadigital.com" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">support@zilyadigital.com</a> / <a href="mailto:admin@zilyadigital.com" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">admin@zilyadigital.com</a></p>
          <p>WhatsApp: <a href="https://wa.me/6282157204572" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-emerald-400 hover:underline">+62 821-5720-4572</a></p>
          <p>Alamat: Muara Teweh, Kalimantan Tengah, Indonesia</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  ) : (
    <article class="space-y-8">
      <div class="border-b border-zinc-800 pb-8">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
          Legal & Compliance
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-zinc-400 mt-2">Last updated: {lastUpdatedEn}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 leading-relaxed text-zinc-300">
        <p>
          Welcome to <strong>ZilyaDigital</strong> (accessible from <a href="https://zilyadigital.com" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">zilyadigital.com</a> and <a href="https://nazilah.id" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">nazilah.id</a>). The privacy of our visitors and clients is one of our utmost priorities. This Privacy Policy document outlines the types of personal data we collect, how it is utilized, and how your rights are safeguarded.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white pt-4 border-t border-zinc-800/80">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          We collect personal data you provide directly when registering for a client portal account, scheduling consultations, or collaborating on digital engineering projects:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Identity & Contact Details:</strong> Full name, corporate or personal email address, phone/WhatsApp number, and company/brand name.</li>
          <li><strong>Project Specifications:</strong> Technical requirements, UI/UX assets, deliverables, and communication records.</li>
          <li><strong>Billing Information:</strong> Invoice records, subscribed packages, and payment confirmation metadata. Credit/debit card numbers are never stored on our servers; payments are processed securely via licensed gateways (e.g. DOKU).</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white pt-4 border-t border-zinc-800/80">2. Google User Data Policy (Google OAuth)</h2>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-900/80 border border-blue-500/30 space-y-3">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path fill="#4285F4" d="M22.56 12.25c0-.78-.07-1.53-.2-2.25H12v4.26h5.92c-.26 1.37-1.04 2.53-2.21 3.31v2.77h3.57c2.08-1.92 3.28-4.74 3.28-8.09z" />
              <path fill="#34A853" d="M12 23c2.97 0 5.46-.98 7.28-2.66l-3.57-2.77c-.98.66-2.23 1.06-3.71 1.06-2.86 0-5.29-1.93-6.16-4.53H2.18v2.84C3.99 20.53 7.7 23 12 23z" />
              <path fill="#FBBC05" d="M5.84 14.09c-.22-.66-.35-1.36-.35-2.09s.13-1.43.35-2.09V7.06H2.18C1.43 8.55 1 10.22 1 12s.43 3.45 1.18 4.94l2.85-2.22.81-.63z" />
              <path fill="#EA4335" d="M12 5.38c1.62 0 3.06.56 4.21 1.64l3.15-3.15C17.45 2.09 14.97 1 12 1 7.7 1 3.99 3.47 2.18 7.06l3.66 2.84c.87-2.6 3.3-4.52 6.16-4.52z" />
            </svg>
            Google Sign-In Authentication Integration
          </h3>
          <p>
            When you choose <strong>"Continue with Google"</strong> or <strong>"Sign up with Google"</strong>, we request read-only access to standard OAuth scopes (<code class="text-xs bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">openid</code>, <code class="text-xs bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">email</code>, <code class="text-xs bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">profile</code>).
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li><strong>Accessed Data:</strong> Your name, Google-verified email address, and profile photo URL.</li>
            <li><strong>Purpose:</strong> Seamlessly authenticating your identity, linking or creating your client workspace profile, and issuing secure session tokens.</li>
            <li><strong>Limited Use Compliance:</strong> ZilyaDigital's use and transfer of information received from Google APIs to any other app will adhere to <a href="https://developers.google.com/terms/api-services-user-data-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-400 underline">Google API Services User Data Policy</a>, including the Limited Use requirements.</li>
            <li><strong>No Data Brokering:</strong> We never sell, lease, or transmit Google user data to data brokers or third-party advertising platforms.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white pt-4 border-t border-zinc-800/80">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>Operate and administer the ZilyaDigital client portal.</li>
          <li>Deliver status updates regarding project milestones, software releases, and billing invoices.</li>
          <li>Provide customer support, engineering assistance, and respond to inquiries.</li>
          <li>Detect and mitigate unauthorized access or security incidents.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white pt-4 border-t border-zinc-800/80">4. Data Security & Storage</h2>
        <p>
          Your information is stored securely in encrypted cloud datastores (TLS 1.3 / HTTPS). Client session cookies are marked <code class="text-xs bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">HTTPOnly</code> and <code class="text-xs bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">SameSite</code> to eliminate cross-site script vulnerabilities.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white pt-4 border-t border-zinc-800/80">5. Your Rights & Data Erasure</h2>
        <p>
          You have the right to request access to, correction of, or permanent deletion of your stored account data:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Revoking Google Access:</strong> You can revoke application access at any time via <a href="https://myaccount.google.com/permissions" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-400 underline">Google Account Security Settings</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>Account Erasure:</strong> To permanently delete your client account and all related metadata, submit a request to <a href="mailto:support@zilyadigital.com" class="text-blue-400 underline">support@zilyadigital.com</a>.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white pt-4 border-t border-zinc-800/80">6. Contact Information</h2>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 text-sm space-y-1">
          <p><strong>ZilyaDigital Agency</strong></p>
          <p>Email: <a href="mailto:support@zilyadigital.com" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">support@zilyadigital.com</a></p>
          <p>WhatsApp: <a href="https://wa.me/6282157204572" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-emerald-400 hover:underline">+62 821-5720-4572</a></p>
          <p>Location: Muara Teweh, Central Kalimantan, Indonesia</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  )}
</div>